@FutureShopBackend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5003

### Swagger OpenAPI Specification
GET {{FutureShopBackend_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### Get Category Tree
GET {{FutureShopBackend_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Search Catalog Products (Marketplace vs ThirdParty filter)
GET {{FutureShopBackend_HostAddress}}/api/products?sellerType=Marketplace&sortBy=Popular&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Get Current Session
GET {{FutureShopBackend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
